1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:02,809
Ten sick men begged Jesus for mercy.

2
00:00:03,433 --> 00:00:05,480
He sent them off, still sick.

3
00:00:06,179 --> 00:00:07,399
They were cleansed on the road.

4
00:00:08,139 --> 00:00:09,539
Only one of them came back.

5
00:00:10,979 --> 00:00:12,699
They'd stood at a distance, as their

6
00:00:12,759 --> 00:00:16,359
disease required, and cried out, "Jesus, Master,

7
00:00:16,799 --> 00:00:17,919
have mercy on us."

8
00:00:19,180 --> 00:00:21,819
He told them, "Go shew yourselves unto

9
00:00:21,859 --> 00:00:22,539
the priests."

10
00:00:22,639 --> 00:00:24,019
They obeyed before they could see any

11
00:00:24,079 --> 00:00:24,599
difference.

12
00:00:25,420 --> 00:00:27,180
"And it came to pass, that, as

13
00:00:27,239 --> 00:00:28,899
they went, they were cleansed."

14
00:00:29,939 --> 00:00:30,879
Nine kept going.

15
00:00:31,519 --> 00:00:33,919
One turned back, "and with a loud

16
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:36,419
voice glorified God, and fell down on

17
00:00:36,459 --> 00:00:38,219
his face at his feet, giving him

18
00:00:38,279 --> 00:00:38,680
thanks:

19
00:00:39,479 --> 00:00:40,839
and he was a Samaritan."

20
00:00:41,899 --> 00:00:44,719
Jesus asked it out loud, naming exactly

21
00:00:44,759 --> 00:00:46,619
what nine men had skipped:

22
00:00:46,659 --> 00:00:48,180
"Were there not ten cleansed?

23
00:00:48,860 --> 00:00:49,899
but where are the nine?

24
00:00:50,799 --> 00:00:52,279
There are not found that returned to

25
00:00:52,319 --> 00:00:55,180
give glory to God, save this stranger."

26
00:00:55,319 --> 00:00:56,779
To the one still on his face,

27
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:00,119
he said, "Arise, go thy way:

28
00:01:00,180 --> 00:01:01,879
thy faith hath made thee whole."

29
00:01:02,199 --> 00:01:04,299
Nine had exactly what they'd asked for,

30
00:01:04,699 --> 00:01:05,639
and kept walking.

31
00:01:07,080 --> 00:01:08,299
One turned back to him.

32
00:01:09,220 --> 00:01:10,399
Luke calls it thanks.

33
00:01:11,400 --> 00:01:12,739
Jesus calls it faith.

34
00:01:14,568 --> 00:01:15,612
Nine went on clean.

35
00:01:16,124 --> 00:01:17,067
One came back whole:

36
00:01:17,700 --> 00:01:19,678
at His feet, not on the road.
